  "family": "global",
  "lineage": "Shadow-puppet theatre singing of Shuangquan village in Huayin, eastern Shaanxi, long kept within the Zhang family lineage and listed as national intangible cultural heritage in 2006. The lead singer plays the yueqin, with erhu, large and small gongs, bangzi and a wooden block (jingmu) pounded on a long bench, and the whole troupe joins in on the refrains (the muyu card stands in for the bangzi and the bench-struck block).",
